- `192.0.2.0/24`, `198.51.100.0/24`, `203.0.113.0/24` (Documentation ranges, RFC 5737)
- `240.0.0.0/4` (Reserved/future use)
- `255.255.255.255` (broadcast)

These are unlikely SSRF targets but could be added for completeness.

